    "description": {
      "title": "About the Project",
      "text1": "Gardarr is a modern, lightweight management and analytics tool designed specifically for qBittorrent. Built with a focus on mobile optimization, it provides an intuitive interface for monitoring and managing your torrents from any device.",
      "text2": "The project is open-source and community-driven, prioritizing clean, maintainable code that can be self-hosted by anyone. Whether you're managing a single instance or multiple agents, Gardarr offers the tools you need in a beautiful, responsive interface."
    },
